{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19102070","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19102070","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1910207001:0":{"text":"摩淖亚，你总算来了！今天怎么这么晚？","source_cn":"摩淖亚，你总算来了！今天怎么这么晚？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x4E9B79F30B5D1E85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910207002:1":{"text":"你旁边的是谁，家族的小辈吗？除了皮肤足够光滑，其他的地方怎么和海月家的人一点都不像？","source_cn":"你旁边的是谁，家族的小辈吗？除了皮肤足够光滑，其他的地...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x65654E67C86C9CB4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"254371","variant_female_record_index":"254372","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910207003:0":{"text":"呵呵……飞鳞还是这么有精气神。","source_cn":"呵呵……小飞鳞还是这么有精气神。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xF0065BFEB48F8D30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910207004:0":{"text":"摩淖亚微笑着向家族代表们介绍了你，包括你救了艾菲拉一事……海裔们的态度比想象中更友好，纷纷欢迎你来塔拉萨做客。","source_cn":"摩淖亚微笑着向家族代表们介绍了你，包括你救了艾菲拉一事...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xCC1BF1E0CAB01386","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910207005:0":{"text":"外面的世界太危险了。摩淖亚，你该多劝劝你的子嗣，乖乖待在有珊瑚保护的塔拉萨。","source_cn":"外面的世界太危险了。摩淖亚，你该多劝劝你的子嗣，乖乖待...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xEC8842943F9996FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_